00:31:02.830 --> 00:31:03.497
MARK MANDEL: OK.

00:31:03.497 --> 00:31:04.960
MARK MIRCHANDANI:
So what the Helm?

00:31:04.960 --> 00:31:07.240
[BOOING]

00:31:07.240 --> 00:31:08.917
